    "created_at": "2017-01-17T20:09:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-17T20:09:30Z",
    "body": "Thanks for finding this. I agree with your suggested change.\r\n\r\nWould you be able to help us by writing web platform tests covering the spec change? I.e. things that would behave differently with the current spec vs. with a spec that merged the two stacks.\r\n\r\nIn particular, it seems like the change to inert everything outside the top layer would have noticeable impacts on fullscreen (e.g. you would no longer be able to tab around to non-fullscreened elements).\r\n\r\nIt would be especially good to get @foolip's perspective as I believe he is still working on finishing up Blink's unprefixed fullscreen implementation.",
