    "body": "On Gecko side, @nt1m is currently implementing `<dialog>` support, and we already have top layer implementation for fullscreen, so there are questions about how we should handle their interaction.\r\n\r\nBlink already has `<dialog>` with top layer, and @foolip is currently working on fullscreen with top layer. I suppose he would also meet similiar issue when handling them?\r\n\r\nI'll try to write a test for that change.",
