    "updated_at": "2017-01-24T12:50:23Z",
    "body": "Good catch, @upsuper! I haven't worked with `<dialog>` before, but it looks like Blink doesn't have a \"pending dialog stack\" at all, `dialog.showModal()` just pushes to the top layer. So having just top layer and flags for additional book keeping SGTM.\r\n\r\nBut, what effect does being in the pending dialog stack actually have? Tests for this would be great to clarify. Regarding the inert stuff, I'm not sure how tabbing currently works in fullscreen, and would be unsurprised if there are problems :)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
