    "created_at": "2017-02-08T21:52:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-08T21:52:15Z",
    "body": "Based on testing of https://jsbin.com/fakivinege/3/edit?html in Chrome it seems like fullscreen does not make everything else on the page inert. I'm going to assume we want to keep that for now.\r\n\r\nI'll make things \"blocked by a modal dialog\" if there is a dialog in the top layer. The topmost dialog will be the one blocking.\r\n\r\nAgain, help writing tests will be much appreciated. Spec PR coming soon.",
