    "updated_at": "2017-05-24T09:16:36Z",
    "body": "In https://github.com/whatwg/fullscreen/pull/91 we're thinking about making it impossible for `dialog` elements to go fullscreen, in which case strictly speaking no flags would be needed to distinguish why something is in top layer. However, that could be an optimization.",
